From e8a44db47713f3de46cb88246ba4ab064e559897 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:39:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Accept API keys on library reads and job history

The project, mesh, and splat lists, and GET /v1/jobs/session, only
checked the website session cookie. A valid ArtCraft API key was 401.
Those reads now use the existing API-key-or-cookie lookup. A present
Authorization header does not fall through to the cookie. Job history
still allows the anonymous visitor cookie when no key is sent.
---
